00:45:48.420 --> 00:46:01.110
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>She was playing them on speakerphone and her assistant principal overheard, came in to help Dr. Hill transcribe in case she needed these messages for something in the future, maybe as evidence, she thought.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>她在扬声器上播放它们，副校长听到了，进来帮助Hill博士转录，以防万一她未来需要这些留言做点什么，也许作为证据，她想。

00:46:01.110 --> 00:46:08.520
<v Disgruntled Caller 7>How about we end up outside your guys' houses? We're not going to protest the school. We'll go directly to your bloody fucking homes.
<v Disgruntled Caller 7>如果我们去你们家里怎么样？我们不会抗议学校。我们将直接去你们血淋淋的该死的家。

