00:46:18.800 --> 00:46:30.050
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>As a person who has transcribed a lot of audio because of my job, it takes a really long time. And if you are trying to get it word for word, you have to go back over and over again.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>作为一个因为工作原因转录过很多音频的人，这需要很长时间。如果你想逐字逐句，你必须一遍又一遍地回去。

00:46:30.050 --> 00:46:39.080
<v Teresa Hill>Yeah, I mean, there were times where I was-- we would look at each other and I was like, did they say this or did they say that? And she would say, I heard this. I'm like, oh, I heard this. So let's play it again. And we would play it again.
