00:46:39.080 --> 00:46:45.620
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>To be like, did he say, you definitely are a sick ass or you suck ass?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>就像，他说的是，你绝对是个烂透了的人还是你烂透了？

