00:55:10.690 --> 00:55:11.560
<v Teresa Hill>Yeah.
<v Teresa Hill>是啊。

00:55:11.560 --> 00:55:17.500
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>So then when you did, did it feel like, oh, I don't want to give them what they wanted?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>所以当你辞职时，感觉就像，哦，我不想给他们想要的？

00:55:17.500 --> 00:55:28.390
<v Teresa Hill>Of course. Of course. But I had to really dig deep and do what was best for me.
