00:55:28.390 --> 00:55:52.160
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>What was best for her was the one choice that was completely out of character, something far from her principalness and all her familiar moves. She decided not to be "it" anymore.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>最适合她的是那个完全不符合性格的选择，远离她的校长作风和所有她熟悉的举动。她决定不再是“那个角色”了。

